{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/811946-hunters-aspect-and-other-splats","id":811946,"title":"Hunters aspect and other splats","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-01-19T10:59:16-08:00","id":811946,"title":"Hunters aspect and other splats","content":"So as I got a comment that there was a change: Do hunters aspects of werewolves work on other supernatural splats? (thus can a Rahu put <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:GoudyOldStyleT-Regular\">Submissive Condition</span></span><br /> on a vampire, demon, mage,....)?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/914-ryu","name":"Ryu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"330"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-19T11:15:35-08:00","id":811957,"title":"","content":"Yes, they work on other supernatural entities. For the Composure + Primal Urge roll contesting the attempt to place the Hunter's Aspect, Targets replace Primal Urge with a relevant replacement (a vampire uses Blood Potency, a Demon uses Primum, spirits and ghosts and angels use Rank, etc).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>- Chris Allen, Aberrant Line Developer, Freelance Writer<br /> <br /> \u200bLike my work? Feel like helping me stay supplied with tea? Check out my <b><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/acrozatarim\" target=\"_blank\">Patreon</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1757-acrozatarim","name":"Acrozatarim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-19T11:17:24-08:00","id":811959,"title":"","content":"I don't see why not. Werewolves hunt down other werewolves, spirits, claimed, etc. Not seeing how it would make sense to limit the effects of the <i>Siskur Dah</i> to only human (which only one Tribe &quot;hunts&quot;).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-19T11:56:50-08:00","id":811991,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/811946-hunters-aspect-and-other-splats?p=811959#post811959\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't see why not. Werewolves hunt down other werewolves, spirits, claimed, etc. Not seeing how it would make sense to limit the effects of the <i>Siskur Dah</i> to only human (which only one Tribe &quot;hunts&quot;).</div> </div> </div> </div>And that one tribe (iron masters) is specifically quoted to also hunt vampires,.... <br /> <br /> which is why I was confused when I had heard that statement and thus asked to make sure that I'm not ovelrooking anything.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Acrozatarim</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/811946-hunters-aspect-and-other-splats?p=811957#post811957\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yes, they work on other supernatural entities. For the Composure + Primal Urge roll contesting the attempt to place the Hunter's Aspect, Targets replace Primal Urge with a relevant replacement (a vampire uses Blood Potency, a Demon uses Primum, spirits and ghosts and angels use Rank, etc).</div> </div> </div> </div>Tnx chris! It is then as I had originally thought. That one comment had confused me so had to make sure that I'm correct there. tnx!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/914-ryu","name":"Ryu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"330"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}